    kind: invariant  # 64bd
    title: "go.yaml's 20 third-party method rows declare a package-identifier module (gin.Context) that no Go program can produce, so the entire third-party method surface is unreachable — and ADR-0016 sec 27 says those rows should not ship at all"  # 64bd
    status: violated  # 64bd
    priority: 2  # 64bd
    parent:  # 64bd
    tags:  # 64bd
